Cloudflare Pages Asset Ignore Configuration

This file prevents specified files and directories from being uploaded to the global CDN edge

Ignore system files and operating system metadata

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.git/
.github/

Ignore raw design drafts, high-resolution source files, and backups

This prevents heavy development resources from consuming CDN edge bandwidth

*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
*.fig
*~
*.bak

Ignore local development dependencies, logs, and temporary environment files

node_modules/
.log
npm-debug.log
yarn-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
